<title>USA: Tulsa Cty ISD 9, Okla., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Tulsa Cty ISD 9, Okla., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $13.675 million of Tulsa Cty ISD 9, Okla., building bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.99 percent.</p>
</text>
